---
<section class="bg-white">
  <div class="wrap pb-16 lg:pb-28">
    <div class="stage grid items-center gap-10 overflow-hidden px-6 py-10 sm:px-10 sm:py-14 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,440px)] lg:gap-16 lg:px-16 lg:py-20">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-5">
        <p class="text-[clamp(84px,14vw,168px)] font-extrabold leading-[0.88] tracking-[-0.05em] text-ink" aria-label="9:58 PM">9:58<span class="ml-[0.08em] text-[0.42em] tracking-[-0.02em] text-faint">PM</span></p>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-2">
          <div class="bubble bubble-customer max-w-[420px] text-[17px]">Can I move my Thursday appointment to Friday?</div>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-[6px] pl-1 text-[14px] font-bold leading-[1.3] text-danger"><span class="size-[7px] rounded-full bg-danger" aria-hidden="true"></span>No reply</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-2 pt-2">
          <span class="pl-1 text-[14px] font-semibold leading-[1.3] text-faint">7:05 AM</span>
          <div class="bubble bubble-customer max-w-[420px] text-[17px] font-semibold">Never mind, I’ve booked somewhere else.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-5">
        <h2 class="h2">After closing time, the questions keep coming.</h2>
        <p class="lead max-w-[440px]">Most small businesses reply the next morning. By then, some of those customers have already booked with whoever answered first. AI Front Desk answers them while you’re closed.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
